WEBVTT

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:37.750
I'm sorry.

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:41.030
How can you
cancel the interview?

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.770
I'm sorry for
being unreasonable.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:47.220
I want my players to
focus on their match.

00:01:57.490 --> 00:02:00.440
Understood. Good luck.

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:02.230
Excuse us.

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:03.900
Thank you.

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:07.920
Coach.

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:15.260
The interview's canceled. We don't need
to give Takao any more unnecessary shocks.

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:20.960
As long as Takao remains
aware that he's the champion,

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:23.630
he's forgotten the heart
of his own style of battle.

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:26.700
Why? Ya moron!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:30.920
I'm the champion! I can't turn
my back on whoever I fight!

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:36.240
That's it! That's when I realized
what makes an ideal champion!

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:40.160
And that's cool, right? It totally is!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.150
That's how I decided!

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:46.620
In our battle against F-Sangre, I'm going to fight them in their comfort zone,

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:50.960
and win, fair and square,
like a champion should!

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:54.790
This is a path every
champion has to go down.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.920
Saying it's his destiny
isn't an overstatement.

00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:01.070
Takao will get past
that pressure, right?

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:02.770
Yeah.

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:04.910
Right, but...

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:08.490
This is a wall Takao has
to get over on his own.

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:10.440
With his own hands.

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:23.340
What the heck
happened to me?

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.120
Dragoon!

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.700
I couldn't bring
out my usual power.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:31.410
Kai, Rei, Max...

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:43.450
I need to fight them...

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.830
Just like a
champion should.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:00.130
Hamburgers
are so awesome!

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:05.240
So no interview, huh?

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:11.810
Bladers all over the world would have
loved an interview with the BBA Revolution.

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:15.790
I guess we'll change the
topic to Beyblading teamwork...

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:19.430
Are you old dudes from TV?

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.130
Old dudes?

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:25.840
Aren't you Daichi Sumeragi
from the BBA Revolution?

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:27.610
That's me!

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.420
It's a camera!

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:33.160
A camera! Yay! Peace!

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.240
Make sure you film
my good side!

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:37.900
We just got turned
down for an interview.

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.990
Aww, who cares?

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:43.990
If I say it's okay,
then there's no problem!

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.920
Are you really
approving the interview?

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:47.190
Yeah!

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:49.770
Just leave it all to me!

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:51.520
Peace!

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.630
Bladers all across the globe!

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:11.030
Today we'll be doing a whole day's worth of
coverage on the BBA Revolution's Takao Kinomiya!

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:14.580
We'll be revealing all of the
secrets to the champion's strength!

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.650
Good morning!

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:18.690
Morning.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:22.060
We'll be counting on
you for today's coverage.

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:24.290
I hope Takao
will be okay...

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:28.830
Takao himself okayed it,
so we can't stop it now.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:31.940
They're focusing on Takao?

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:35.390
I even put on
my best pants!

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:38.080
What a ripoff!

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:40.210
Butt out for once!

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:43.540
What's your problem, hag?!

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:45.240
Hag?!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.420
Okay!

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:47.970
Good work.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:53.430
This all-day coverage
stuff is making me nervous.

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:55.990
We're just getting started.

00:05:55.990 --> 00:06:01.070
We'll be filming every detail of
the daily life of Takao Kinomiya!

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:02.450
Looking forward to it!

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:04.050
Yeah...

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:09.340
The coverage will end with a talk
with your rivals at Ayers Rock!

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:10.460
With them?

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:14.180
Yessir! We'd like to end
the episode with you

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:18.050
declaring war on your
rivals just ahead of the finals.

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:20.410
With the passion
of a champion!

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.270
As a champion...

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:24.720
Yes! Like a champion should!

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:26.720
Like a champion should...

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:32.230
Champon is delicious, isn't it?

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:35.590
I want to have champon
with tons of vegetables!

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:37.500
The hotel might have some!

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:43.460
Lemme out, you hag!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.620
Don't leave me here!

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:48.380
Oww!

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:54.740
A balanced meal!

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:56.850
This is one secret
to his strength.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:01.080
You can't become a strong
Blader if you're a picky eater!

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.420
Okay, champion!

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:05.650
Champion...

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:12.340
Can't Beyblade on
an empty stomach!

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:14.570
I'm the BBA's...

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.420
The great Daichi Sumeragi...

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:19.830
Moron.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:26.750
Takao does laps at the
pool for a full body workout.

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:31.260
Okay! That's good, champion!

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.220
--Daichi!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:43.400
I'm the great Daichi
Sumeragi from the BBA!

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.810
A peach?

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:58.500
He's trying to appeal
to the camera...

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.600
But it just looks like
he's getting in the way.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:06.840
Float like a butterfly,
sting like a bee!

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:11.210
This is the BBA's Daichi
Sumeragi's secret to his training!

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.960
--Wait, no!!
--Wait, no!!

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:36.830
We can't tape like this.

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:39.920
Let's film Beyblade practice next.

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:42.010
Looking forward to it, champion!

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:45.870
Champion this,
champion that...

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.840
Starting to piss me off.

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:51.360
Camera ready!

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:55.580
Kinomiya, give us a
good champion's battle!

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:56.850
Yeah.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:04.780
I've gotta show 'em how
strong my Beyblade is.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:09.790
Here's an exclusive look at
the BBA team's battle practice.

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:10.480
Three!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:11.250
Two!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.100
--One!

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:13.750
Go, Shoot!

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:17.380
Takao!

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:19.100
He shot late!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.090
Go, Gaia Dragoon!

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:27.120
Keep it up, Einstein 2!

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.760
Go, Dragoon!

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:35.520
What?
Come on, Dragoon!

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.010
Faster!

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:39.860
What's happening?

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:43.300
The champion Kinomiya's
Dragoon has stalled!

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:44.470
Takao!

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.690
A Beyblade is a
mirror of one's soul.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:51.320
Takao's self-doubts and pressure about being
the champion are reflecting onto his Beyblade.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:55.570
Darn it! What's gotten
into you, Dragoon?

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.450
Takao! I knew it...!

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.770
What's the matter, champion?

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:04.420
Oh, shut up!
Engine Gear, full throttle!

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:13.990
Go!

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:16.610
Frog Splash!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:21.390
Crap!

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.200
Come on, Dragoon!

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:25.910
Go wild like you always do!

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:32.190
Gaia Dragoon attacks Dragoon!

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:50.210
Kinomiya, Stadium Out...

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.850
Takao...

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:56.680
This sucks.
The champion lost...

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:59.170
Hey! That's mean!

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:00.320
He's right!

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:01.760
It's okay.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:06.240
I'm not worthy of being a
champion with a battle like that.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.680
--Takao...

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:10.960
I'm done.
Leave me alone for a bit.

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:17.700
Takao!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:21.900
Takao...

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:55.090
Tomorrow's our match
with Takao. I can't wait.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:58.030
I've dreamed about
this day countless times.

00:11:58.240 --> 00:11:59.920
Takao...

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:04.900
That wasn't how
you usually fight.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:14.910
What's up with you, Takao?

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:29.090
So cute!
They're like stuffed dolls!

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:31.670
Is this alright?
We've got a match tomorrow.

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:34.670
Don't worry about
the little stuff now!

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:38.210
Relaxing like this
is way better!

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:40.770
You just might be right.

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:44.050
Are you sure you just didn't
want to go see the koalas?

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:46.550
Definitely not!

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:48.690
Then why are you
so quick to object?

00:12:48.690 --> 00:12:51.710
Come on, Rai!

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:55.910
We're having so much fun!
Rei should have joined us.

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:58.760
And this little guy
here is just so cute!

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:13.640
Kinomiya...

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.540
Rei...

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:21.150
Is this about
Takao too, Kai?

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:22.770
So what?

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.570
We're his teammates...

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:38.410
It's rough not being able
to do anything for him.

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:43.380
Takao... Getting past this pressure is
what'll make you a real champion.

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:50.260
We can't film with
Kinomiya in that condition...

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.260
Too bad...

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:11.740
The Australian stage
finally begins tomorrow!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:15.410
Like it or not, this is the
end of the league battles!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:19.140
Neo-Borg leads with
three wins and one loss!

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:23.600
Behind them are the
BBA Revolution, PPB All Starz,

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:25.480
Baihuzu, and F-Sangre.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:29.140
These four teams are bunched
together at two wins and two losses!

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:32.880
It's gonna be a free-for-all where each
of these five teams has a chance to win!

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:38.990
Who will be the top two teams to
advance to the finals tomorrow?

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:43.640
You'll find out in tomorrow's
matches! Check it out!

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:49.160
I'm the champion, so I have to
have heated battles with them...

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:51.070
And yet...

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:09.200
I'm...

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:12.760
--Kinomiya!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:13.250
--Takao!

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:14.310
I... I...!

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:15.600
Kinomiya!

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:16.500
Takao!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.040
Shut up!

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.280
Takao!

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:26.260
It's just you, Daichi...

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:27.950
It's not "just me!"

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:29.260
Yellin' out like that.

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:32.090
And what was up
with that battle?

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:33.850
Are you even trying?!

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:35.330
Oh, shut up.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.740
Shut up?!

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.570
Yeah! Shut up!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:40.870
This has nothing to
do with you! Beat it!

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:43.410
Don't gimme that attitude!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.260
Dragoon...

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:52.720
I don't know what your problem is,
but right now you're lame, Takao!

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:53.610
Lame?

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:55.010
You're super lame!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.090
That's not the
Takao I know!

00:15:57.090 --> 00:16:00.900
So I'm gonna beat your
passion right out of you!

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:05.980
I'll make you
eat those words!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.540
Darn it! Again!

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:12.370
Get your act together, Takao.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:13.920
Shut up!

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:17.470
Darn!

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:19.490
Takao, take this seriously!

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:21.690
Are you makin' fun of me?

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:25.630
I thought you
were the champion?

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:28.900
Shut up! Shut up!!

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:31.990
It's always champion this,
champion that!

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:36.000
You would never understand
the pressure of being champion!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.680
Pressure?

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:45.280
A champion has to fight exciting
battles like with Kai, Rei, and Max!

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:49.290
And the more I think about it,
the more my body freezes up!

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:51.230
Pressure...?

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:53.420
What am I doing?

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:59.360
Do you guys have fun battling like this?
Are you happy winning like this?!

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:02.810
Can you proudly call
yourself a Blader?!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:08.710
I even preached to them about how
they should fight their own way...

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:13.250
And that's cool, right?
It totally is!

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:15.220
That's how I decided!

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:19.730
In our battle against F-Sangre, I'm going to fight them in their comfort zone,

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:24.240
and win, fair and square,
like a champion should!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:27.890
I even made Daichi fight a four-man battle, even though we weren't used to it.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.150
I...

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.740
What the heck am I doing?

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:39.600
I can't win like this.

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:47.670
Takao, don't space out!

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:04.160
This is it!
This is the feeling!

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:07.600
I forgot how this felt!

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:11.600
Takao!

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:14.750
Now this is the
Takao I know!

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:25.730
I have to ignore what doesn't
matter, just like Daichi does.

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:28.780
And just focus
on my Beyblade.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:31.610
It's not about fighting
like a champion.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:35.360
I just have to fight
like Takao Kinomiya!

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:40.980
That's it! I have to find the
answer on my own, like always!

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:43.630
Isn't that right, Dragoon?

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.450
Thanks, Daichi!

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:56.890
Wait up, Takao!

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:59.670
Our battle ain't over yet!

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:02.420
Takao, you got over the wall.

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:08.590
I don't really get it, but
Takao's back to his old self!

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:11.870
What does "pressure"
even mean, anyway?

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:24.500
I came here to see Takao, but I
heard the filming got canceled.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:30.160
Maybe it's not such a good
idea to see him before we fight. But...

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.540
You wanted to
fight Takao at his best.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.450
Yeah. He isn't that soft.

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:40.290
Yeah. Takao can solve
this on his own.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:43.140
If he's a real rival, that is.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:51.780
--Takao!

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:57.990
I came here to say
something to you guys.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:04.430
I'm a Beyblader first,
and a champion second.

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:07.140
Rei. Kai. Max.

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:10.290
From here on out,
I'm the challenger!

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.090
There was nothing
to worry about.

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:32.880
Yeah, you're right.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:05.000
Takao, I accept.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:08.260
Tomorrow, I'm going
to give you my all!

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:11.410
I'm glad Takao's
back to his old self.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:15.380
To the Takao Kinomiya
I left the BBA to fight.

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:17.780
But if I want to
fight Takao again...

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:21.640
There's another wall
I have to surpass first.

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:24.260
Kai! Let's battle!

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:30.870
This is where the
real fight begins.

00:22:55.650 --> 00:22:59.640
Please, sis! Let me fight
the next battle one-on-one!

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:02.310
What're you saying,
Raul? No means no.

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:05.540
If we lose, that's the
end of the line for us!

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:06.580
That's exactly why!

00:23:06.580 --> 00:23:09.230
If I don't do it
tomorrow, I'll regret it!

00:23:09.230 --> 00:23:09.930
I just know it!

00:23:09.930 --> 00:23:11.220
Raul...

00:23:11.220 --> 00:23:16.100
If that's what you want, fine! Go get
that applause with your own strength!

00:23:16.100 --> 00:23:18.210
You'll be fine.
You can win this!

00:23:18.210 --> 00:23:20.360
Yeah. Okay, go!

00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:22.210
Flame Pegasus!
